jobs.content:
&lt;p&gt;At Dexory we believe that real time data will revolutionise the logistics industry. We are building the ultimate data insights platform that provides companies with unprecedented, real time access to their operations. Our autonomous data capturing technology and insights generation capabilities help to measure, track and find goods across warehouses in real time, while building the ultimate digital twin of facilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us at a very exciting time of growth as we’re significantly ramping up all areas of the business to lead the way in logistics data globally, backed by some of Europe’s best VCs and driven by passion, curiosity and teamwork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*We value humility and we&#39;re as interested in your character as we are in your talent. Please apply, even if you feel you only meet part of our listed criteria. Diversity drives innovation and we offer an international and friendly work environment with an energetic company culture.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced, self starting, Account Executive to join our highly ambitious Commercial team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have a focus on identifying and generating opportunities with market leaders within the logistics industry to showcase our transformational technology. You will be responsible for ensuring the growth of our pipeline, keeping a keen eye out for opportunities and solution evangelism while helping with continuous improvement of the sales cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taking a team- based approach to consultative selling, you’ll partner with our Commercial Implementation/Solutions, Product and Marketing teams to ensure a world class end-to-end client experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are looking for a role with a commission up to 100%, this is the role for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be successful in this role you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage &amp;amp; lead the full sales lifecycle, start to finish to meet and exceed quarterly targets and sales quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn, support and find solutions for clients and will consultatively show how Dexory can bring real value in their long term gains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Target and build long term relationships with C-Suite - level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with our VP Business Development to strategise and carry out short/long term onboarding and growth plans for new clients and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working across the whole sales/commercials function during the sales process to ensure each prospect has the appropriate amount of assistance from a technical and functional perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 1 year&#39;s with B2B mid market to enterprise sales . SaaS and logistics experience are strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constantly meeting/exceeding your individual sales quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with establishing relationships with and selling through technology partners and system integrators within the logistics &amp;amp; retail sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in large commercial negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starting from the interview process and continuing into your career with us, you will be working by our four Operating Principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance: High standards, outstanding results,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact: Big challenges, bigger results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment: All in, every time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One team: One mission, shared success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining our team and company isn&#39;t just about expertise; it&#39;s about embracing uncertainty with ambition. We&#39;re crafting world-changing solutions, fueled by a passion to redefine what&#39;s possible. We will look for you to help create and shape the future of logistics solutions through our products, our culture and our shared vision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20 days annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social security etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AAP/EEO Statement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dexory provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment. It prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, colour, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: We are unable to provide sponsorship for this role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At Dexory, we&#39;re developing advanced software powered by cutting-edge robots that are transforming the very face of global logistics. With infectious enthusiasm, our unique blend of disciplines work in harmony to produce results at pace. From hardware and manufacturing to software, AI and commercial, we&#39;re one team – one heart – that beats, learns and grows together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;only&amp;nbsp;interested&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;best&amp;nbsp;ideas,&amp;nbsp;no&amp;nbsp;matter&amp;nbsp;where&amp;nbsp;they&#39;re&amp;nbsp;from.&amp;nbsp;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;doers.&amp;nbsp;Game-changers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out-of-the-box thinkers who put merit before all else. A group of ambitious and disciplined individuals who are passionate about turning theory into rubber, metal and results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*We&amp;nbsp;value&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;right&amp;nbsp;attitude,&amp;nbsp;humility&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;interested&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;character&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;we&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;talent.&amp;nbsp;Please&amp;nbsp;apply,&amp;nbsp;even&amp;nbsp;if&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;feel&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;only&amp;nbsp;meet&amp;nbsp;part&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;listed&amp;nbsp;criteria.&amp;nbsp;Diversity&amp;nbsp;drives&amp;nbsp;innovation&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;we&amp;nbsp;offer&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;international&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;friendly&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;environment&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;energetic&amp;nbsp;company&amp;nbsp;culture.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an experienced Procurement Buyer, your role is to be responsible for executing the day-today procurement activities that support manufacturing operations, ensuring the timely and cost-effective purchase of materials, components, and services. This role plays a critical part in maintaining production continuity by managing supplier orders, monitoring delivery schedules, and resolving supply issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Sourcing Specialist and cross&amp;nbsp;functional teams, the Buyer ensures that materials and outsourced assemblies are available to meet production plans, while maintaining quality, cost, and inventory targets in a fast-growing manufacturing environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;manage&amp;nbsp;purchase&amp;nbsp;orders&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;raw&amp;nbsp;materials,&amp;nbsp;components,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;outsourced&amp;nbsp;assemblies&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;line&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;production&amp;nbsp;schedules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;suppliers&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;confirm&amp;nbsp;order&amp;nbsp;acknowledgements,&amp;nbsp;delivery&amp;nbsp;dates,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;shipment&amp;nbsp;details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expedite&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;defer&amp;nbsp;orders&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;needed&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;align&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;changing&amp;nbsp;demand&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;production&amp;nbsp;priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor&amp;nbsp;supplier&amp;nbsp;performance&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;delivery&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;responsiveness,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;escalate&amp;nbsp;issues&amp;nbsp;when&amp;nbsp;required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;planning,&amp;nbsp;production,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;warehouse&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;ensure&amp;nbsp;material&amp;nbsp;availability&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;inventory&amp;nbsp;accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support&amp;nbsp;onboarding&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;suppliers&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;contract&amp;nbsp;manufacturers&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;setting&amp;nbsp;up&amp;nbsp;purchasing&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;transactional&amp;nbsp;processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;resolve&amp;nbsp;supply&amp;nbsp;issues,&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;shortages,&amp;nbsp;delays,&amp;nbsp;quality&amp;nbsp;concerns,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;invoice&amp;nbsp;discrepancies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support&amp;nbsp;cost&amp;nbsp;control&amp;nbsp;initiatives&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;identifying&amp;nbsp;opportunities&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;savings&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&amp;nbsp;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s&amp;nbsp;degree&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Supply&amp;nbsp;Chain&amp;nbsp;Management,&amp;nbsp;Business&amp;nbsp;Administration,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;related&amp;nbsp;field&amp;nbsp;(or&amp;nbsp;equivalent&amp;nbsp;experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;purchasing,&amp;nbsp;procurement,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;supply&amp;nbsp;chain&amp;nbsp;role,&amp;nbsp;preferably&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;manufacturing&amp;nbsp;environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&amp;nbsp;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;purchasing&amp;nbsp;direct&amp;nbsp;materials&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;managing&amp;nbsp;suppliers&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;manufacturing&amp;nbsp;setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;outsourced&amp;nbsp;assemblies&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;contract&amp;nbsp;manufacturing&amp;nbsp;environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working&amp;nbsp;knowledge&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;Incoterms,&amp;nbsp;logistics,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;international&amp;nbsp;purchasing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starting&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;interview&amp;nbsp;process&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;continuing&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;career&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;us,&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;four&amp;nbsp;Operating&amp;nbsp;Principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance:&amp;nbsp;High&amp;nbsp;standards,&amp;nbsp;outstanding&amp;nbsp;results,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact:&amp;nbsp;Big&amp;nbsp;challenges,&amp;nbsp;bigger&amp;nbsp;results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment:&amp;nbsp;All&amp;nbsp;in,&amp;nbsp;every&amp;nbsp;time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One&amp;nbsp;team:&amp;nbsp;One&amp;nbsp;mission,&amp;nbsp;shared&amp;nbsp;success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining our team and company isn&#39;t just about expertise; it&#39;s about embracing uncertainty with ambition. We&#39;re crafting world-changing solutions, fueled by a passion to redefine what&#39;s possible. We will look for you to help create and shape the future of logistics solutions through our products, our culture and our shared vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share&amp;nbsp;options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private&amp;nbsp;healthcare&amp;nbsp;via&amp;nbsp;Bupa&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;24/7&amp;nbsp;medical&amp;nbsp;helpline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life&amp;nbsp;insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income&amp;nbsp;protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension:&amp;nbsp;4+%&amp;nbsp;employee&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;option&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;opt&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;salary&amp;nbsp;exchange,&amp;nbsp;5%&amp;nbsp;employer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee&amp;nbsp;Assistance&amp;nbsp;Programme&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;mental&amp;nbsp;wellbeing,&amp;nbsp;financial&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;legal&amp;nbsp;advice/support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25&amp;nbsp;holidays&amp;nbsp;per&amp;nbsp;year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full&amp;nbsp;meals&amp;nbsp;onsite&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Wallingford&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;events&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;offsite,&amp;nbsp;snacks&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;all&amp;nbsp;kinds&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AAP/EEO Statement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dexory provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment. It prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, colour, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please&amp;nbsp;note:&amp;nbsp;This&amp;nbsp;role&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;minimum&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;4&amp;nbsp;days&amp;nbsp;onsite&amp;nbsp;at&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;Wallingford&amp;nbsp;location.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;unable&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;provide&amp;nbsp;sponsorship&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;relocation&amp;nbsp;assistance&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;this&amp;nbsp;role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Chief of Staff Execution Lead to work directly with the Chief of Staff on the highest priority initiatives across the business. This is an execution role. You will be handed special projects that sit outside the day-to-day remit of any single department and be expected to drive them to completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Where operations own the company&#39;s operating rhythm, cadences and data frameworks, this role is different. You are the person the Chief of Staff deploys onto specific problems: unblocking stalled initiatives, chasing actions to closure and building the tools and processes that make the whole company move faster. You will collaborate closely with the Business Operations Manager and teams across Dexory, but your remit is defined project by project rather than by a standing operational portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role suits someone relentless. Someone who gets things done, does not take no for an answer and is comfortable holding people senior to them to account with professionalism and tact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal focus would be someone with experience in roles such as founders associate, operations or similar and technical academic background such as degree in computer science or similar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Projects: &lt;/strong&gt;Take ownership of discrete, high priority internal projects assigned by the Chief of Staff, from scoping through to delivery and handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiative Support: &lt;/strong&gt;Support company initiatives by coordinating contributors, chasing inputs and ensuring the right people deliver the right things at the right time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountability Enforcement: &lt;/strong&gt;Track actions, owners and deadlines across leadership forums and follow up persistently until items are closed. Escalate blockers early and with evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving Outcomes: &lt;/strong&gt;Move initiatives from discussion to decision to delivery. Propose solutions rather than reporting problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Efficiency Implementation: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify friction in how the company operates and implement practical fixes, from process changes to tooling improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Centre of Excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;Help establish a centre of excellence for efficiency and speed, codifying best practice on how Dexory plans, executes and delivers so it can be reused across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with the Business Operations Manager and department leads so that project work lands cleanly alongside existing operating cadences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success Measures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-Time Delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Assigned projects and initiatives are delivered and executed on time, with slippage flagged and recovered early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Action Closure: &lt;/strong&gt;Actions from leadership forums are closed within agreed deadlines, with a measurable reduction in overdue items.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Efficiency Gains: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrable improvements in speed or cost from implemented process changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Confidence: &lt;/strong&gt;The Chief of Staff and executive team trust that anything handed to this role will get done without being chased.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5+ years in a high-pace environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering projects end to end, including examples of pushing work over the line against resistance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong tooling and automation capability. Comfortable identifying inefficiencies and solving them quickly with practical solutions, whether that is process automation, workflow tools or building something yourself, such as a tracker in Excel, from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with modern productivity and AI tools, and quick to learn new ones. You default to building a solution today rather than requesting one for next quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organisation and follow-through. Nothing you own falls through the cracks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident, direct communication with stakeholders at all levels, including senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience and persistence. You chase, you follow up, and you do not accept vague commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgement on when to push, when to escalate and when to solve it yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starting from the interview process and continuing into your career with us, you will be working by our four Operating Principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance: High standards, outstanding results,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact: Big challenges, bigger results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment: All in, every time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One team: One mission, shared success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining our team and company isn&#39;t just about expertise; it&#39;s about embracing uncertainty with ambition. We&#39;re crafting world-changing solutions, fueled by a passion to redefine what&#39;s possible. We will look for you to help create and shape the future of logistics solutions through our products, our culture and our shared vision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare via Bupa with 24/7 medical helpline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income protection&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension: 4+% employee with option to opt into salary exchange, 5% employer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Programme - mental wellbeing, financial and legal advice/support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 holidays per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full meals onsite in Wallingford&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun team events on and offsite, snacks of all kinds in the office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AAP/EEO Statement &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dexory provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment. It prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, colour, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced CNC Turner to programme, set and operate advanced Fanuc-controlled CNC lathes with live tooling and twin-spindle capability. You will manufacture precision components for our robots, taking parts from engineering drawing or CAD model through programming, setup, first-off inspection and repeat production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with our engineering and manufacturing teams on new components, process improvement and the continued development of automated and unattended CNC production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CNC Machines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will primarily involve the following DN Solutions machines:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PUMA 2600SYB&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PUMA 1300TT SSYB&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PUMA 2100TT SSYB&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programme, set and operate Fanuc-controlled CNC turning centres.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce precision components from engineering drawings, CAD models and manufacturing specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programme and prove twin-spindle operations, live tooling and multi-axis machining processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and optimise CNC programs using Fanuc controls, Fusion 360 CAM and verification software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select appropriate cutting tools, inserts, holders, workholding, speeds and feeds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacture prototypes, small batches and repeat-production components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete machine setups, including tooling, workholding, datum setting and tool-offset management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out first-off and in-process inspection using appropriate measuring equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure components meet dimensional, geometric tolerance and surface-finish requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering to provide practical design-for-manufacture input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve setup times, cycle times, tool life, process reliability and material utilisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot programming, tooling, dimensional and machining issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear setup sheets, tooling records and inspection documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support probing, tool-life monitoring, standardised setups, machine tending and lights-out machining.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other CNC machining activities where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, hands-on experience programming, setting and operating Fanuc-controlled CNC lathes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with twin-spindle CNC turning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience programming and operating live or driven tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and interpret engineering drawings, including GD&amp;amp;T.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of cutting tools, inserts, workholding, speeds and feeds.&lt;/li&gt;
