&lt;li&gt;A proactive, problem-solving mindset, with the demonstrated ability to address technical challenges effectively on customer premises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and reliability,&amp;nbsp; your work sets the foundation for a successful deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to present technical information clearly and professionally to diverse audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
