&lt;li&gt;Investigate degradation signals and turn them into alerts or engineering tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit fleet configuration, detect drift, drive it back to baseline, and simplify the configuration so drift is harder to create in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track component-level health and feed preventive maintenance intervals and the monthly fleet health report.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce clear evidence packs for engineering and hardware decisions: what is failing, how often, where, and what it costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed findings into playbooks so Robot Support can act on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Robot Support and Commissioning to close the loop between what fails in the field and what we check before robots ship.&lt;/li&gt;
