&lt;li&gt;Linux and log analysis, and enough ROS to interpret what a robot was doing when it failed — or the clear appetite to learn it quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and persistence — most of the value is in noticing what nobody reported.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written communication; findings nobody can read do not get fixed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measured on.&lt;/strong&gt; Issues detected before customer impact, repeat incidents eliminated, alert quality, and config compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
