&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;WMS or ERP integration experience (SAP, Manhattan, Oracle WMS, or similar).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
