&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a reliable Robotics Logistics Associate to be responsible for the precision packing and secure dispatch of high-value, cutting-edge robotics. This role requires a white-glove mindset, combining mechanical aptitude with the physical logistics skills needed to move our technology safely from our facility in Wallingford to our global partners. If you are a disciplined &quot;doer&quot; who takes pride in the security and presentation of high-performance machinery, this is your chance to start your career in the robotics industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role will be Wallingford based when not travelling.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precision Packing:&lt;/strong&gt; Custom pack and secure high value robots and spares into specialised transit cases, ensuring they are protected against all transit conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mechanical Assembly:&lt;/strong&gt; Use manual and power tools, including screwdrivers and impact drivers to secure robots and seal heavy duty export crates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safe Loading:&lt;/strong&gt; Safely maneuver robots and large scale equipment onto vans and transport vehicles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory Accuracy&lt;/strong&gt;: Document all outgoing shipments ensuring conclusive paperwork for all outbound shipments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dangerous Goods Handling: &lt;/strong&gt;Multi Modal shipping of Dangerous Goods by Air, Sea and Road.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warehouse Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate a forklift to move heavy crates and manage space within the dispatch area to maintain an agile, high performance workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross Functional Preparation&lt;/strong&gt; Liaise with internal and external stakeholders to organise all preparation of outbound goods across Client Operations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience using hand and power tools (specifically impact drivers and screwdrivers) for technical assembly or heavy duty packing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with fragile, high value, or sensitive equipment where attention to detail is paramount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in warehouse operations, shipping, or fulfillment; experience with &quot;Dangerous Goods&quot; export is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle the physical demands of moving large robots and loading transport vehicles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A valid forklift license is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &quot;one team&quot; attitude, the ambition to learn the robotics field from the ground up, and a commitment to high standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipping experience desirable (IATA, IMDG, ADR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
