&lt;p&gt;Dexory is a fast-moving technology company transforming warehouse operations through cutting-edge robotics, autonomous systems and real-time data intelligence. We work with some of the biggest names in logistics, including GXO, Maersk and DHL, and we are a career defining company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every robot we ship starts with a plan. That is where you come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a new opportunity for a Production Planner to join our dedicated team based at our Robotics Campus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for planning and coordinating production schedules to ensure our robots are built efficiently and delivered to customers on time. Working closely with teams across Procurement, Stores, Engineering and Production, you&#39;ll ensure materials, resources and priorities are aligned. You&#39;ll also play a key role in improving planning processes as we continue to scale and grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer orders, demand forecasts and delivery commitments into realistic production schedules. Proactively identify changes, assess capacity and adjust plans to maintain on-time delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manage MRP requirements, anticipate material shortages and work closely with Procurement to ensure components are available when needed, including long-lead-time items.&lt;/li&gt;
